IMPLEMENTATION PART of Extent Report ->Listners
---------------------
Step 1 -Add the Maven Dependency in POM

<dependency>
    <groupId>com.aventstack</groupId>
    <artifactId>extentreports</artifactId>
    <version>5.1.2</version>
</dependency>

Step 2 - Create a Class Test001_ExtentReportManager implements ITestListene for Generate Reports
Sep 3 - Step 2 - Create a Class Test002_MyListners implements ITestListene  for to listen the events this is for default

step 4 - create the xml file with Report Listers and test case  or both


<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE suite SYSTEM "http://testng.org/testng-1.0.dtd">
<suite name="All Test Suite">
    <listeners>

        <listener class-name="TestNgFolder.Test007ListnersAndReportgeneration.Test001_ExtentReportManager"></listener>

    </listeners>
    <test name = "Test">
        <classes>
            <class name="TestNgFolder.Test007ListnersAndReportgeneration.Test003"/>
        </classes>
    </test>
</suite>